During healing period for osseointegration. Cover screw protects the internal structural fixture and depending on placement depths there are different specification related to cover screw. Please remember this.

199
00:28:17,000 --> 00:28:26,000
Healing abutment which creates transmucosal hole you need to choose accordingly with the gingival thickness.

200
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:30,000
And size of the prosthesis to be fabricated.

201
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:40,000
Impression coping which is essential in prosthesis fabrication can be divided into regular, mini, long, and short.

202
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:48,000
You need to use it well and differentiate them, if you choose wrongly at times you may not be able to take impression.

203
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:52,000
Please differentiate them and choose wisely. 

204
00:28:55,000 --> 00:29:02,000
When I first did implant treatment. There were so many components and I found myself baffled.

205
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:12,000
Details on components, especially those around prosthesis. Those were very new to me and felt very difficult.

206
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:18,000
I hope the master course you not make the same mistakes that I did.

207
00:29:18,000 --> 00:29:25,000
Please remember the components, what they're called and their specifications.

208
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:27,000
When you're doing implant treatment.

209
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:29,000
Thank you for watching.

